1
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,860
[On Xu Qingdao's birthday]

2
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:41,970
Tianbai,

3
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:46,780
do you think I should go?

4
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,060
Of course.

5
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:53,240
This meal is your best chance,

6
00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:54,490
and also

7
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:57,660
your last chance.

8
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:07,010
Let's go.

9
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:15,030
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 21]

10
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:40,509
Who is it?

11
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:42,820
Miss,

12
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,009
why are you here?

13
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:45,310
Are you going to attack me?

14
00:01:45,310 --> 00:01:45,870
No.

15
00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:47,729
Miss, what are you talking about?

16
00:01:47,729 --> 00:01:48,850
Hurry up and leave.

17
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:50,160
You're an eyesore here.

18
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,759
I'm leaving.

19
00:01:57,610 --> 00:01:58,470
Come out.

20
00:02:03,610 --> 00:02:05,210
The key to Xu Qingdao's safe.

21
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,420
Don't look around after you go in.

22
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:19,650
It will make him suspicious.

23
00:02:19,650 --> 00:02:20,170
Yes.

24
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:42,700
Blue.

25
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:45,040
It seems this is the antidote.

26
00:03:15,170 --> 00:03:16,630
After waiting for so long,

27
00:03:17,420 --> 00:03:20,020
the distinguished guest
has finally arrived.

28
00:03:20,370 --> 00:03:22,530
You must be joking, Sir.

29
00:03:22,550 --> 00:03:23,829
Don't be so polite.

30
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,600
After all, we're so close.

31
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:29,710
Tianbai,

32
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:31,620
we meet again.

33
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,900
You're surprised, aren't you?

34
00:03:41,579 --> 00:03:42,380
Director.

35
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,460
It doesn't matter what you call me.

36
00:03:44,460 --> 00:03:46,990
What's important is that
the person is right,

37
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,570
then everything is right.

38
00:03:48,570 --> 00:03:50,490
Chief Xu, don't you agree?

39
00:03:50,690 --> 00:03:51,570
You are right.

40
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:52,890
Come on,

41
00:03:53,570 --> 00:03:54,530
what are you waiting for?

42
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:55,190
Have a seat.

43
00:03:56,230 --> 00:04:00,070
Sir used the lives of 58 dock workers
from the Qingtian Gang

44
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:01,650
to threaten Lu Wenbiao.

45
00:04:02,540 --> 00:04:04,060
If he transports the goods just once,

46
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,390
and he would let them go.

47
00:04:05,930 --> 00:04:07,690
Lu Wenbiao agreed.

48
00:04:08,130 --> 00:04:09,450
What an idiot.

49
00:04:10,270 --> 00:04:12,190
Sir works for foreigners,

50
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:14,240
conducting Wolfbane experiments
in Ningcheng.

51
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,519
Sir said they are all consumables.

52
00:04:16,970 --> 00:04:17,970
The more people die,

53
00:04:17,970 --> 00:04:19,209
the more data we get.

54
00:04:19,790 --> 00:04:21,390
Some of my subordinates

55
00:04:21,769 --> 00:04:23,820
were also involved in the experiment.

56
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:25,060
They have good foundations,

57
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:27,140
so they are used to study
the maintenance dose.

58
00:04:27,140 --> 00:04:29,140
Their lives are worthless anyway.

59
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:32,580
Chief Xu,

60
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:35,250
you've worked hard all these years.

61
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:35,950
Come,

62
00:04:36,540 --> 00:04:37,470
let me toast you.

63
00:04:37,490 --> 00:04:38,450
Not at all.

64
00:04:38,990 --> 00:04:41,520
The Shisha Gang owes its success today
to you.

65
00:04:41,770 --> 00:04:44,300
I'll drink it all, you can drink
as you please.

66
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:51,450
Do you really think so?

67
00:04:52,330 --> 00:04:53,130
Of course.

68
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,620
We are all old.

69
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:05,700
Ningcheng ultimately belongs to
the young people.

70
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,040
Chief Xu,

71
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:08,740
today is your birthday.

72
00:05:09,050 --> 00:05:11,050
I specially prepared a gift for you.

73
00:05:12,650 --> 00:05:13,530
Great.

74
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:32,500
This is...

75
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,580
This is to make you keep your eyes open

76
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:36,880
and see the people around you clearly.

77
00:05:37,090 --> 00:05:41,090
Otherwise, you wouldn't even know
if an undercover infiltrated Shisha Gang.

78
00:05:41,090 --> 00:05:41,890
What?

79
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:43,610
You are the birthday boy today,

80
00:05:43,610 --> 00:05:44,870
so I won't let you do it.

81
00:05:45,090 --> 00:05:45,880
I'll do it.

82
00:05:53,630 --> 00:05:54,670
So it's him.

83
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,000
Lu Ye.

84
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,300
Something’s wrong.

85
00:05:59,300 --> 00:06:01,160
Something happened at Dashijie.

86
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:13,870
Are you shocked?

87
00:06:14,140 --> 00:06:15,070
Don't be afraid.

88
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:22,080
You know I'm the real undercover.

89
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:23,860
Why?

90
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:26,090
It doesn't matter who you are.

91
00:06:27,410 --> 00:06:30,610
What matters is that you are useful.

92
00:06:31,850 --> 00:06:32,850
And he is useless.

93
00:06:33,090 --> 00:06:35,220
Useless things should be thrown away.

94
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:37,470
You've been undercover by his side
for so long,

95
00:06:37,470 --> 00:06:38,930
and he didn't even notice.

96
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:42,180
What's the point of keeping
a piece of trash like him?

97
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:44,760
Why would I give you up for him?

98
00:06:46,250 --> 00:06:48,780
You've always been
my favorite subordinate.

99
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:49,490
Come.

100
00:06:49,490 --> 00:06:50,010
Sit.

101
00:06:55,980 --> 00:06:57,180
I suppose

102
00:06:57,530 --> 00:06:59,630
you still have many questions for me.

103
00:07:00,050 --> 00:07:00,850
Go ahead.

104
00:07:01,770 --> 00:07:04,890
The mole in the police station
is your man.

105
00:07:05,810 --> 00:07:09,410
That's why we couldn't find anything
no matter how hard we tried.

106
00:07:11,250 --> 00:07:13,010
Don't put it so harshly.

107
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:15,650
They are your colleagues

108
00:07:15,650 --> 00:07:16,820
and my subordinates.

109
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:18,620
Everyone just does their own job

110
00:07:18,810 --> 00:07:20,470
and manages different areas.

111
00:07:21,130 --> 00:07:22,650
You colluded with the gang

112
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:25,970
and even split the police station
into two factions.

113
00:07:25,970 --> 00:07:28,970
Your people have long become corrupt cops.

114
00:07:30,650 --> 00:07:31,450
Smart.

115
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:33,350
From the very beginning,

116
00:07:33,350 --> 00:07:35,950
you knew about my undercover plan
with Master.

117
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:37,730
All of this

118
00:07:39,690 --> 00:07:41,290
was tacitly approved by you.

119
00:07:44,370 --> 00:07:45,330
That's right.

120
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:46,650
Why didn't you stop it?

121
00:07:47,370 --> 00:07:48,730
Why should I?

122
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,830
With you there,

123
00:07:50,050 --> 00:07:51,930
you could keep an eye on things for me.

124
00:07:51,930 --> 00:07:53,800
Xu Qingdao has never been honest.

125
00:07:54,890 --> 00:07:57,250
And I also wanted to see your abilities

126
00:07:57,250 --> 00:07:58,850
and how far you could go.

127
00:07:59,050 --> 00:08:00,090
Sure enough,

128
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,780
you didn't let me down.

129
00:08:02,410 --> 00:08:04,070
What exactly do you want to do?

130
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:06,450
I want

131
00:08:07,330 --> 00:08:09,090
to give the Shisha Gang to you.

132
00:08:12,370 --> 00:08:13,170
Don't rush.

133
00:08:13,770 --> 00:08:15,230
I know what you want to say.

134
00:08:15,570 --> 00:08:17,970
Officer Shen is the embodiment of justice.

135
00:08:18,850 --> 00:08:21,110
Why would he be willing to do
such a thing?

136
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:22,650
But let me tell you,

137
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:24,610
what I can give you

138
00:08:24,970 --> 00:08:27,010
is far more than you can imagine.

139
00:08:28,780 --> 00:08:29,820
Wealth,

140
00:08:29,970 --> 00:08:30,730
power,

141
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,309
and fame.

142
00:08:32,770 --> 00:08:34,450
When you have all of this,

143
00:08:34,570 --> 00:08:36,169
any of them

144
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:39,830
is much more interesting
than your so-called justice.

145
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:41,429
Even if

146
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:43,710
you are not interested in this,

147
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:44,660
don't you

148
00:08:45,170 --> 00:08:47,130
want to protect Ningcheng?

149
00:08:48,310 --> 00:08:48,990
Tianbai.

150
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:50,690
I think you also know

151
00:08:50,810 --> 00:08:54,210
that the line between black and white
is hard to distinguish.

152
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,820
To control the darkness,

153
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:58,950
the best way is to blend into it.

154
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:02,620
Once you become the leader of Shisha Gang,

155
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:03,660
I promise

156
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,700
you will be in charge of the underworld.

157
00:09:11,650 --> 00:09:12,450
How about it?

158
00:09:14,050 --> 00:09:15,090
Are you tempted?

159
00:09:15,850 --> 00:09:16,770
Will you agree?

160
00:09:18,850 --> 00:09:19,890
I won't agree.

161
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:22,980
Who is it?

162
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:23,750
Stop.

163
00:09:27,810 --> 00:09:29,270
I've always wanted to know

164
00:09:29,810 --> 00:09:31,390
who exactly is helping the Qingtian Gang

165
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:32,630
make a comeback.

166
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,100
So it's you, Sir.

167
00:09:36,370 --> 00:09:39,690
You're quite a clever kid.

168
00:09:40,850 --> 00:09:41,890
You flatter me.

169
00:09:42,490 --> 00:09:44,690
But not clever enough to read your mind.

170
00:09:46,010 --> 00:09:48,140
You promised to support our Qingtian Gang.

171
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:49,870
Why did you go back on your word?

172
00:09:50,210 --> 00:09:51,270
Xu Qingdao is dead.

173
00:09:51,410 --> 00:09:52,050
Perfect.

174
00:09:52,420 --> 00:09:53,730
The Shisha Gang has disbanded.

175
00:09:53,730 --> 00:09:55,530
So his territory should be mine.

176
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:58,490
What do you mean by letting him take over?

177
00:10:00,350 --> 00:10:01,280
Enough.

178
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:02,580
Stop acting.

179
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:07,460
Did you think I didn't know
about your little tricks?

180
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,960
But I am quite curious.

181
00:10:12,410 --> 00:10:15,140
Why are you working
with your father's murderer?

182
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,160
Because I know you are the real murderer.

183
00:10:19,770 --> 00:10:21,420
You used the lives
of our Qingtian Gang brothers

184
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:22,930
to blackmail my father
into smuggling drugs for you.

185
00:10:22,930 --> 00:10:24,210
Then you exposed it

186
00:10:24,450 --> 00:10:25,450
and silenced him.

187
00:10:25,970 --> 00:10:27,100
What a great scheme.

188
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:32,150
Not bad.

189
00:10:32,170 --> 00:10:33,250
Very impressive.

190
00:10:33,330 --> 00:10:35,790
I didn't think you would find out
about this.

191
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:38,770
You two young men are indeed outstanding.

192
00:10:40,410 --> 00:10:41,410
In that case,

193
00:10:42,610 --> 00:10:44,090
let me add one more detail.

194
00:10:45,170 --> 00:10:46,830
Actually, in the very beginning,

195
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:48,050
I had my eyes on your father,

196
00:10:48,050 --> 00:10:49,250
not Xu Qingdao.

197
00:10:49,660 --> 00:10:51,390
I tried to persuade him nicely,

198
00:10:51,650 --> 00:10:53,690
but your father just wouldn't agree.

199
00:10:53,690 --> 00:10:56,730
He even said he hated drugs the most
in his life.

200
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:58,810
Since that was the case,

201
00:10:59,770 --> 00:11:01,430
I made sure he died from drugs,

202
00:11:01,660 --> 00:11:03,100
in infamy,

203
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:04,970
and despised by everyone.

204
00:11:05,770 --> 00:11:08,610
Do you think
you can see through everything

205
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:10,190
and control everyone?

206
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:11,970
Then guess

207
00:11:12,210 --> 00:11:14,740
why I'm sitting here wasting my breath
on you.

208
00:11:14,850 --> 00:11:15,570
What?

209
00:11:16,110 --> 00:11:16,630
Young Master.
